'''Piledriver Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]] increases her attack power and decreases her recharge time. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.4 Update|Patch 1.0.4]] and could be unlocked when purchasing the Package Version Bonus in either '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') or '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') versions.

