==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], Piledriver Cat, [[Driller Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Driller Cat]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]], [[Backhoe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Backhoe Cat]] and [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]] could only be unlocked when "Grandon Mining Corps" was part of the current pool.
*A darker-colored Piledriver Cat can be seen during the attack animation of [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Guardians]], rising from the ground during the first explosion of magma alongside the other Grandon Mining Corps units, though with two pilots instead of one and a number "02" instead of "07".
**In the Ultra Form, [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Subterra Saviours]], a conceptual Ultra Form design for Piledriver Cat, along with all other Grandon Mining Corps units can be seen during its attack animation. They have the same color scheme of all other [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] Ultra Forms, that being red and black with gold lining.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Piledriver Cat knocks back all enemy types as [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] aren't present in game.
**Since [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] introduced Zombies, Piledriver Cat can target all traits including Zombies, giving her more usage overall.
*She's the only one of the Grandon Mining Corps units who is referred to as female.

